            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "What\u2014what do you mean it hasn't?!",
        "value": "Londinium Worker"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "This takes the piss..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Who was in charge of transporting those materials?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "It was, er, the one in charge, er..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "What are you dithering for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "...It was Feist."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "That boy..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "He went out first thing this morning. Should've been back ages ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Who went with him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Tommy, Patto and Day."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "They're not the same workshop. How'd they get on the same shift?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "They all get along like a housefire. Keep mucking together all the time. Feist's their little ringleader."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053",
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "You've hit a snag, from the sounds of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Small potatoes, nothing more."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Small potatoes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Catherine, you know what day it is today, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "How could I forget?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "`I've been fearing for my life I'll upset our officer if I sign and it looks like fowl scratch. I started practicing my signature ten whole days ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "That's practice under your belt, then. The General's stressing importance hard on the handover ceremony in two days. Reportedly, the Defense Forces' head is showing too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Want a cig?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "...Heh. Pass one here."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "You know why it is all your factory's people have stuck around until now, don't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "We work very hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "That's a given."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "You do your work very well. We're alike in that regard. Work, get paid, scrape a living."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "But our employers know all too well the more exceptional a merc's work, the less he can be trusted."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Standard fare."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Old manager of this industrial park, Sir Humphrey, never trusted us either. Before you dragged him away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Don't make trouble for me, Catherine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mercenary's tone is placid, like he's the one asking Catherine if she wants a smoke. As he so often does."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is his job. Offing a few disobedient Londinium workers to him is almost the same as the screws she tightens on the daily."
    },
    {
        "text": "Catherine taps her cigarette into a bag. Can't have ash falling into the machinery."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "I've told you more times than I can count."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "If you want efficiency maintained, our factory can't afford one fewer worker."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "I admire you a fair bit, Catherine. Even a typical merc might not even have the guts you do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "You've got the stuff. Thing is, it's possible to take anything too far."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "Londinium's got over a hundred munitions factories just like yours. Even if this whole place was dead empty, the Regent wouldn't care."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Nothing will change. The ceremony will come the day after, we'll hand over everything promised, and all our workers will be there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "No need for you lot to worry about a thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "I'll take your word for it, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Of course. Not got a lighter? You're just holding your cig there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_053"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
        "text": "You hold onto it, after all. Londinium smokes always have a sort of engine oil to them. Can't ever get over it."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
