    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Patto! Done there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_659_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Just this screw left!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Sort it out. If this keeps up, they'll be waiting a whole week at least to get more polymer prep."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_659_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Polymer up to our ears, it's just batch after batch coming in. The hell are the Sarkaz building?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I haven't seen. Granny doesn't let me anywhere near the assembly line. Only her most trusted workmates get to climb up that walkway."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "The longer this keeps up, the more it must be very important to the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_659_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Gotta be a weapon, right? We've been pumping out auto-crossbows for the Sarkaz the last few days in the workshop."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Could only be. Still got so many ducal armies outside eyeing us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_659_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Be ghastly letting the Sarkaz get away with this, I tell you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "We've got to stop them, Patto. We can't be helping the Sarkaz fend off our own."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_659_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Think it'd be any use if we destroyed this batch of prep? Think we'd get sentenced?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I'll step up if that's what it comes to. I'm not afraid of being taken in."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
