            "key": "$d_avg_iron_claw",
            "volume": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "On the fly, she grabs a small file and throws it."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$swordtsing1",
            "volume": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$swordtsing2",
            "volume": 0.3,
            "delay": 0.2
        }
    },
    {
        "text": "With a clang, the worker's spanner flies out of his hand and onto the ground."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Do you know what it is you're doing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I'm stopping the Sarkaz!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "You're making a scene."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I've got it all planned! It won't drag any of you in. I'll tell the Sarkaz I did it, and then\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "\u2014and then you'll die at the Sarkaz's hands. You're making yourself out as a hero, aren't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I'll try and flee. I've been planning this forever\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "You're using the crawler you modified. You're hiding on the cargo track, and slipping out of Highbury that way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#11$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "So you knew..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#11$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "I've been living in this industrial park for over fifty years. Whatever silly business you try, it won't slip by me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Granny, listen to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I received some news. There's a rebel organization active in Sudean right now. They've rescued a whole number of people from the Sarkaz, and they've even taken back some plates!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "They call themselves the Londinium Citizens' Self-Salvation Corps\u2014we're going to meet them!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Are you now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "And then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "Er... what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Are they lacking for smiths? Are you going to assemble and automate production pipelines for them, maybe design the next generation of crawlers?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "You can't even put a single armament together. You're going to go up to the people at this Self-Salvation Corps and tell them you want to bash Sarkaz heads in with spanners?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#10$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 20,
            "ystrength": 20,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I'm learning!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I know the stories you've told me, like how you got selected to build steam armor when you were young, and I've heard you spending night after night polishing at power conduits."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "I don't get it... We're Londinium workers, you've been teaching me that since I was little. You've told me how our factory built modern Victoria\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "But now? We're lowering our flag at a handover ceremony, and raising the Sarkaz ensign."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "And then? We're taking the assembly line we're so proud of and producing weapons for the Sarkaz with it, and those weapons will end up pointed at Victorians!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "How can you bear life like this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Like what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Life like this <i>is</i> our life, the life you and your parents have always been living."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Look at this factory."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Nobles with titles longer than their surnames, business tossers with lives built on trade, even the Sarkaz... we've had people posing as its master come and go."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "But the assembly line's still there. The machines still haven't come to a halt. Each rivet that's passed through our hands is still in the place it's meant to be."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Whoever might be occupying that palace in the middle of Londinium, this city we built will still see tomorrow and the day after that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#10$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "But I don't want a tomorrow like this!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "What kind of life is a life without freedom? It's being alive at most, that's it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "If this factory... if Londinium isn't ours any longer, then what was the point of everything we made for it?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "You know, Feist..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Twenty-five years ago, that night when the flames lit up the sky, your dad said much the same thing to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Worker",
        "text": "Boss, the Sarkaz are almost back\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "You're free to go wherever you want."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "But from this moment on, you are forbidden from ever setting foot in the factory again, Feist."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "A worker who won't finish the job with his own hands <i>isn't fit for the job</i>."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Feist",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Anyone who wants to go with him, I won't stop you either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Catherine",
        "text": "Just remember\u2014you step out of this door, and you are no longer one of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
